The application themes bundled with AdocFoundry.

The JSON files are gpui-component theme sets, copied unchanged from the GPUI Kit repository,
https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit, at commit dfc11142ca41249472057dac55372b45b15ab8e8,
from its themes/ folder. GPUI Kit is Copyright 2024 - 2026 Longbridge and licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-gpui-kit).

Each set ports the colours of a theme published under its own licence:

- catppuccin.json: Catppuccin, https://github.com/catppuccin/catppuccin, MIT
  (LICENSE-catppuccin). Latte, Frappe, Macchiato and Mocha.
- tokyonight.json: Tokyo Night by Folke Lemaitre, https://github.com/folke/tokyonight.nvim,
  Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-tokyonight). Night, Storm and Moon.
- solarized.json: Solarized by Ethan Schoonover, https://github.com/altercation/solarized, MIT
  (LICENSE-solarized). Light and Dark.
- everforest.json: Everforest by sainnhe, https://github.com/sainnhe/everforest, MIT
  (LICENSE-everforest). Light and Dark.
- flexoki.json: Flexoki by Steph Ango, https://github.com/kepano/flexoki, MIT
  (LICENSE-flexoki). Light and Dark.
- alduin.json: Alduin by Alessandro Yorba, https://github.com/AlessandroYorba/Alduin, MIT, as
  stated in its colors/alduin.vim (LICENSE-alduin). Dark.
- asciinema.json: the asciinema theme of asciinema-player, https://github.com/asciinema/asciinema-player,
  Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-asciinema-player). Dark.
- gruvbox.json: Gruvbox by Pavel Pertsev, https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox, MIT, as stated in
  its README.md and package.json (LICENSE-gruvbox). Light and Dark.
- hybrid.json: Hybrid by Andrew Wong, https://github.com/w0ng/vim-hybrid, MIT, as stated in its
  colors/hybrid.vim (LICENSE-hybrid). Light and Dark.
- jellybeans.json: Jellybeans by NanoTech, https://github.com/nanotech/jellybeans.vim, MIT, as
  stated in its colors/jellybeans.vim (LICENSE-jellybeans). Dark.
- macos-classic.json: macOS Classic by Jason Lee, https://github.com/huacnlee/zed-theme-macos-classic,
  MIT (LICENSE-macos-classic). Light and Dark.
- mellifluous.json: Mellifluous by Ramojus Lapinskas, https://github.com/ramojus/mellifluous.nvim,
  MIT (LICENSE-mellifluous). Light and Dark.
- spaceduck.json: Spaceduck by Guillermo Rodriguez, https://github.com/pineapplegiant/spaceduck,
  MIT (LICENSE-spaceduck). Dark.

aurora.json is GPUI Kit's own theme, Aurora Light, under GPUI Kit's licence alone.

Only themes whose original project states one of these licences are bundled. GPUI Kit's other
themes are not: Adventure, Adventure Time and Kibble (no licence known), Fahrenheit and Harper
(CC-BY-SA-4.0), Molokai (based on Monokai, whose copyright its licence keeps apart), Twilight
(no licence stated) and Ayu (taken from Zed's repository).
